<section class="section nebu" id="nebu">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Flagship future city</span>
    <h2>NEBU by CitySphere</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      NEBU is CitySphere's flagship future city — a destination, a public realm, and a lived experience.
      Its name is drawn from <em>nbw</em> (gold), signalling value, warmth, prosperity, light, and
      permanence. CitySphere develops the physical city, connects it digitally, and operates it
      intelligently across the long term.
    </p>

    <p class="value-note">
      Premium but broadly accessible: reliable essential services, privacy by design, and measurable
      performance — not speculative spectacle.
    </p>

    <h3 style="margin-top: var(--s6);">How NEBU operates</h3>
    <p>CitySphere runs on a simple, accountable loop:</p>

    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="num">01 — Sense</div>
        <h3>Sense</h3>
        <p>Connected sensors and city systems capture what is happening, in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="num">02 — Understand</div>
        <h3>Understand</h3>
        <p>Operating intelligence turns raw signals into clear, accountable insight.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="num">03 — Respond</div>
        <h3>Respond</h3>
        <p>Cities act through defined workflows — detect, assess, assign, intervene, verify.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="num">04 — Improve</div>
        <h3>Improve</h3>
        <p>Measured evidence feeds continual improvement of services and outcomes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
